# Floor invariant 7 of 16 (spec/floor-v2.md §4). Layer: floor.
# Statement carries the floor prose verbatim.
"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/invariant-07-predeclare-criteria"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/Invariant"
label: "Predeclare criteria"
layer: "floor"
statement: >
  Predeclare criteria before the run that answers them; judge results only
  against them. A refuted hypothesis is a successful experiment. Mixed outcomes
  stay mixed — never round toward a verdict. Timebox exploration; when the
  decision point arrives, resolve with what you have.
